Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 12:36:39 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 29/31] freedreno/a2xx: keep ir2 asserts in release builds

compile_error() and ir2's other checks are asserts. With -Db_ndebug=true a
shader ir2 can't handle (tmp_array dynamic loop reads) compiled to garbage and
wedged the GPU, where the debug build aborted the process. A crash is
recoverable; a Xenos hang needs a power cycle.

